  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FBO- PACANET</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PACANET II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FBOs enjoy the comparative advantage of presence and continuity factors. They also have systems that are well developed but they lack capacity to effectively report on their work. The project also targets religious leaders to declare their sero status and thus act as shining examples for others also to come out. Training of clergy incorporates HIV to make them more relevant to social realities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FBOs njuta av komparativa f&#xf6;rdel n&#xe4;rvaro och kontinuitet faktorer. De har ocks&#xe5; system som &#xe4;r v&#xe4;l utvecklade, men de saknar f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att effektivt rapportera om sitt arbete. Projektet riktar sig ocks&#xe5; religi&#xf6;sa ledare f&#xf6;r att deklarera sin sero status och d&#xe4;rmed fungera som lysande exempel f&#xf6;r andra ocks&#xe5; att komma ut. Utbildning av pr&#xe4;st</narrative>
  </description>
